# .twbx is a zip archive that embeds the packaged data
# source's connection metadata, INCLUDING the RDS endpoint
# hostname in plaintext inside the .twb. Verified with
# unzip + grep. Never commit one from a live database
# connection without checking. See cyclistic-analytics/README.md.
*.twbx
*.twb
